1
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:48,830
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,490 --> 00:01:51,930
[Episode 19]

3
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,040
You're awake.

4
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:33,840
You seem to have a low fever.

5
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:35,960
Have some warm sugar water.

6
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,590
I can do it myself.

7
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,590
Let me.

8
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,110
It's just that

9
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:22,920
my blood sugar dropped.

10
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:24,690
Don't worry about me.

11
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,200
I'm going to get you something.

12
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,190
Is this

13
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:39,430
where you live?

14
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,659
Isn't it good here?

15
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:46,070
It's pretty cool.

16
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:57,560
So these are

17
00:04:58,510 --> 00:04:59,710
what you usually eat?

18
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:05,920
Sometimes I'm too lazy to cook.

19
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:08,560
It's more convenient to eat these.

20
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,120
Have you...

21
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:35,240
Have you suffered a lot?

22
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,380
Nope.

23
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,500
I'm doing pretty well.

24
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,190
As a guy,

25
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:48,540
I don't care much about these things.

26
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,240
What do you do now?

27
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:05,570
I make handmade speakers for people.

28
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,610
Occasionally, there are also

29
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:10,090
some weird custom orders.

30
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:12,610
You could say I'm a craftsman.

31
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,500
Which school did you go to?

32
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:23,030
I have a self-taught diploma.

33
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,570
I won't mention the school.

34
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,920
It's not important in our industry anyway.

35
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,180
It's fine
as long as the work is done well.

36
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,840
What about me?

37
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:39,159
Why don't you ask how I'm doing?

38
00:06:41,270 --> 00:06:41,920
You...

39
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,730
must be doing great.

40
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:48,920
You are Lin Zhixia.

41
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,620
I'm sure a bachelor's, Master's, or Ph.D

42
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,970
wouldn't be a problem for you.

43
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,530
You must be young

44
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,720
but highly respected at school.

45
00:07:01,630 --> 00:07:02,430
Now you've

46
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:06,360
really grown into a young lady.

47
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,140
Then why have you never contacted us?

48
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,920
They are all so smart.

49
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,170
They must've gotten into good schools

50
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,860
and had great futures.

51
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,020
What about you?

52
00:07:25,630 --> 00:07:26,830
What about yourself?

53
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,360
How have you been these past 5 years?

54
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:31,070
I...

55
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,520
I'm different from you guys.

56
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,180
You've been studying.

57
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:42,560
I've just been making a living.

58
00:07:44,050 --> 00:07:46,800
You...
You know that's not what I want to hear.

59
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:50,670
You...

60
00:07:52,230 --> 00:07:54,430
You should have something to eat first.

61
00:07:58,630 --> 00:08:00,030
Can we not talk about this

62
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:01,950
for now?

63
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:07,870
Jiang Yubai,

64
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,160
I just want to know

65
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:12,610
how you've been these past 5 years,

66
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,760
and what happened 5 years ago

67
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:17,160
that made you disappear all of a sudden.

68
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,750
None of us could find you.

69
00:08:18,770 --> 00:08:20,120
Why did you hide from us?

70
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:25,520
I'm right in front of you now, aren't I?

71
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:28,070
Everything is exactly as you see it.

72
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:31,010
What's the point
of getting to the bottom of this?

73
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,600
Do you know that
you disappeared for 5 years?

74
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,789
For 5 whole years!

75
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,360
I've been looking for you
for 5 whole years!

76
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,360
It's been so long, Jiang Yubai!

77
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,490
Do you even see us as your friends?

78
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,440
What are we to you anyway?

79
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:55,720
You were looking for me.

80
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:59,970
Did I have to appear
just because you were looking for me?

81
00:09:02,550 --> 00:09:03,360
Lin Zhixia,

82
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:06,790
you're not just a genius.

83
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:10,170
You are also like a sun.

84
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,870
Pure,

85
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,910
bright,

86
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,840
and shining.

87
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,230
You shine so brightly

88
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,390
and warm others.

89
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:28,150
But not everyone can keep shining forever,

90
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,150
just like you.

91
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,750
At least I can't.

92
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,720
But I've found you now.

93
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:40,150
We can face it together.

94
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,250
This world is really complicated.

95
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,270
There are dark places

96
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,530
where even your light can't reach.

97
00:09:53,630 --> 00:09:55,120
I can help you.

98
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:58,240
How would you know?
You haven't even tried.

99
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,740
I don't need your help.

100
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,510
And you can't help me anyway.

101
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:06,650
This is my own business

102
00:10:07,030 --> 00:10:08,690
and has nothing to do with you.

103
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,730
It has nothing to do with me?

104
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,000
Yes,

105
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,980
it does have nothing to do with me.

106
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,550
Then what does this watch
have to do with you?

107
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:25,720
Why did you fix it?

108
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,870
You had been hiding for 5 years!

109
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:28,200
Why did you show up now?

110
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,840
Why didn't you just keep hiding?

111
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,720
Yes!

112
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,800
Yeah, I shouldn't have fixed it.

113
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,630
I'm an idiot.

114
00:10:36,150 --> 00:10:37,150
Are you happy now?

115
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:39,720
My biggest regret now is

116
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,390
ever fixing this stupid watch.

117
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:43,320
I should never have let you find me!

118
00:10:54,230 --> 00:10:56,650
[Peng]

119
00:10:59,260 --> 00:10:59,940
[Peng]

120
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,850
I have something to handle.

121
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:14,070
You should leave now.

122
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,000
You drove me away.

123
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:49,320
Fine.

124
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,910
I know you live here now.

125
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:56,230
You can't hide away anymore.

126
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:42,000
Look at you.

127
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,470
You're bold now, huh?

128
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:45,510
You even dare to reject my call.

129
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,200
I was outside just now

130
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,520
and couldn't answer.

131
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:53,390
But, Peng, I've paid this month's money.

132
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,150
I know.

133
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:56,210
I've never asked you for more.

134
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,550
But with the bank
raising interest rates now,

135
00:12:59,550 --> 00:13:01,330
my rates are also going up.

136
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:02,960
So starting next month,

137
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,770
your interest will be increased by 3%.

138
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,120
Wait...

139
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,280
The interest rate was
already raised before.

140
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,000
And it's already pretty high.

141
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,920
If you raise it again,

142
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,610
won't it just become usury?

143
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,000
Jiang,

144
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:20,090
you can't say that.

145
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:22,600
When your mother's scandal
blew up back then,

146
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,400
with such a huge financial hole,

147
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:27,370
would any normal institution
have given you a loan?

148
00:13:27,410 --> 00:13:29,650
If I hadn't reached out to help
because I thought you were young

149
00:13:29,650 --> 00:13:30,720
and promising,

150
00:13:31,030 --> 00:13:33,030
you'd still be hiding somewhere.

151
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,180
Got it? I was helping you
in your hour of need.

152
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,840
I'm also having a hard time now.

153
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,960
With inflation

154
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,000
and a bunch of bad debts out there
that can't be collected,

155
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,390
shouldn't you try to understand me a bit?

156
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:57,080
If you think
the interest rate is too high,

157
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,720
I have a solution.

158
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,770
I have a few games next week.

159
00:14:02,890 --> 00:14:04,090
You come with me.

160
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,790
You're brainy.

161
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:08,130
Help me count cards,

162
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,320
and the interest will stay the same.

163
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,030
How's that?

164
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,640
Peng.

165
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,960
It is only natural to pay off debts.

166
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:18,270
I'll pay every bit of interest
I'm supposed to.

167
00:14:18,270 --> 00:14:20,200
But I'm staying out of other stuff.

168
00:14:20,790 --> 00:14:22,250
I can't help you with this.

169
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,150
Very well.

170
00:14:31,130 --> 00:14:32,390
You've got some nerve.

171
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,390
Well, then, starting next month,

172
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:35,870
the interest rate will go up by 3%.

173
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:37,330
You shall pay every penny.

174
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,590
[Jiang Yubai]

175
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:52,690
[The alumni list of Nanhai No.1 High School
(mentions "Jiang Yubai")]

176
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,940
[The Star of Hope—Provincial Math Contest]

177
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,410
[Jiang Yubai won the first prize.]

178
00:14:58,810 --> 00:15:01,280
[Local News]

179
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:05,840
[Master Jiang's Repair]

180
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:06,480
[Master Jiang fixed
my grandpa's military-merit radio.]

181
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:07,130
[He can listen to "Katyusha" once again.]

182
00:15:10,300 --> 00:15:11,270
Master Jiang fixed

183
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:13,050
my grandpa's military-merit radio.

184
00:15:13,050 --> 00:15:15,250
He can listen to "Katyusha" once again.

185
00:15:15,630 --> 00:15:16,750
I saved up for 6 months

186
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:18,770
and finally got
Master Jiang's handmade speaker.

187
00:15:18,770 --> 00:15:21,360
With sweet highs, accurate mids,
and powerful bass,

188
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:24,290
it beats factory products
in the 10,000-yuan range.

189
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:26,480
It's said that
Master Jiang was a legendary top student

190
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:28,390
who refused Qingbei University
despite lowered requirements.

191
00:15:28,390 --> 00:15:29,670
Does anyone know why?

192
00:15:29,770 --> 00:15:30,970
I can't figure it out.

193
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,550
Just forget it if you can't figure it out.

194
00:15:35,550 --> 00:15:36,650
College students are a dime a dozen,

195
00:15:36,650 --> 00:15:38,160
but craftsmen are scarce.

196
00:15:38,490 --> 00:15:40,020
Isn't it good to have a mechanical genius?

197
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,630
They say
as long as you bring up a concept,

198
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:42,630
Master Jiang can make anything.

199
00:15:42,630 --> 00:15:43,790
That's so amazing.

200
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,740
He's basically like a human 3D printer.

201
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:49,050
It's also said that he's very handsome

202
00:15:49,050 --> 00:15:50,320
but very short of money.

203
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,750
Does anyone know why?

204
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,680
[He's excellent in mechanics, processing,
and adjustment. It's just reasonable.]

205
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,000
Cheng,

206
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,520
about Jiang Yubai...

207
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:16,950
I mean, Master Jiang.

208
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:20,940
I'd like to know
what he's been through these years.

209
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:23,200
Didn't I tell you to delete her contact?

210
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,720
Why do you still keep it?

211
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:26,440
Bro, I know your relationship.

212
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,550
But she's our client.

213
00:16:27,550 --> 00:16:28,270
Of course, I have to keep it,

214
00:16:28,270 --> 00:16:28,870
in case of after-sales service...

215
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:30,720
There is no after-sales service!

216
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,050
I won't take her orders!

217
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,870
Give me the phone.

218
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:35,510
Bro.

219
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:36,320
Give it to me!

220
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:46,110
[Miss Lin]

221
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:48,470
[Settings] [Delete Contact]

222
00:16:48,490 --> 00:16:49,680
[Deleting the contact, "Miss Lin"]

223
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:51,040
[Loading]

224
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,710
[Settings]

225
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,030
Get out.

226
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,480
Okay.

227
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:00,840
I'll take my leave then.

228
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:32,110
Guess what I brought you.

229
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:38,550
This is from the restaurant
you said you really liked last time.

230
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:39,680
It was freshly made,

231
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:41,110
and I brought it over immediately

232
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:42,790
without delaying for a single minute.

233
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:43,720
Give it a try now.

234
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,660
I don't like it anymore lately.

235
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:47,510
I'm tired of it.

236
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,240
Tired of it?

237
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,870
Then what do you like to eat?

238
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:53,900
I'll bring it over to you right away.

239
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:56,030
Cut the small talk.

240
00:18:56,110 --> 00:18:57,310
Just cut to the chase.

241
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:01,750
Well, um...

242
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:04,790
Tang.

243
00:19:06,270 --> 00:19:07,070
Tingting.

244
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:11,030
Madam Tang, Miss Tang.

245
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:12,720
Look.

246
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,920
I have a shared e-bike company,

247
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,270
right?

248
00:19:16,270 --> 00:19:17,730
It's called "Fun Biking."

249
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:21,270
This is it.

250
00:19:21,290 --> 00:19:23,650
It needs a bit of promotion lately.

251
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:27,400
Well, we've known each other for years,

252
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:29,400
and we're old friends.

253
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:32,680
See if your company
has any suitable artists

254
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:35,160
whom you can help us
discuss a collaboration

255
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,580
or an endorsement with.

256
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:39,750
Our artists are very expensive.

257
00:19:40,270 --> 00:19:42,160
That's exactly why I came to you!

258
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:43,400
Look.

259
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,510
Isn't our old classmates' friendship

260
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:47,350
worth a million or so?

261
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:48,400
Besides,

262
00:19:48,590 --> 00:19:51,050
if we really make
our collaboration happen,

263
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:53,200
I will cover all the transportation needs

264
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,790
of your company.

265
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:57,840
Duan Qiyan, are you serious?

266
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,890
We are a talent agency!

267
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,720
What do we need your e-bikes for?

268
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,750
Do you expect our artists

269
00:20:02,750 --> 00:20:05,480
to ride your e-bikes
to attend their work events?

270
00:20:06,170 --> 00:20:08,630
Your employees
can ride them as well, right?

271
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,480
Hello?

272
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,320
Tingting,

273
00:20:15,510 --> 00:20:17,590
I brought Mr. Wang
an iced Americano this afternoon.

274
00:20:17,590 --> 00:20:18,790
He was so happy

275
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:21,000
and even helped me
refine my acting this afternoon.

276
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:21,800
You know what?

277
00:20:22,070 --> 00:20:23,640
The directors all praised me today,

278
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,070
saying that I captured the emotions well,

279
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:26,400
and my eyes told the story.

280
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,750
Great job!

281
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:28,480
Keep it up.

282
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,410
Don't get cocky.

283
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,590
Tell me if anything happens.

284
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:31,790
Okay, I got it.

285
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:33,180
Tingting, I've got to go now.

286
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:34,830
They're calling me. Bye-bye.

287
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:35,360
Bye-bye.

288
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,790
"Great job!"

289
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,510
"Bye-bye."

290
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,200
Tang, not bad.

291
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,480
He is now

292
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,810
giving you real-time updates on his work.

293
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,400
That's why they say

294
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:52,640
kids always behave well.

295
00:20:54,790 --> 00:20:55,590
Yeah,

296
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:58,960
He is well-behaved and sensible.

297
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,750
He follows my suggestions 100%,

298
00:21:01,750 --> 00:21:03,350
so of course things turn out well.

299
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:04,880
Unlike you, Duan Qiyan.

300
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:08,110
How many suggestions
have I given you since we were little?

301
00:21:08,110 --> 00:21:09,550
From choosing your college

302
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:11,920
to starting a business
with shared e-bikes,

303
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:14,240
have you ever listened
to a single piece of my advice?

304
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,590
You always do the opposite

305
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:16,650
and bicker with me.

306
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,200
Why should I listen to you?

307
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,510
Only a kid
who's still wet behind the ears like him

308
00:21:21,510 --> 00:21:23,370
would listen to whatever you say.

309
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:24,310
I, Duan Qiyan,

310
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:26,480
am a man with my own ideas and opinions.

311
00:21:26,790 --> 00:21:28,070
What's so great about getting resources

312
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:29,470
by sweet-talking women?

313
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,030
Then what did you come
to our company today?

314
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:33,830
Isn't it just that your own company
is struggling,

315
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:35,000
and you're here to piggyback on our fame?

316
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:35,400
Hey...

317
00:21:35,410 --> 00:21:36,440
Duan Qiyan, listen.

318
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:38,310
Your acting is terrible.

319
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:40,790
Your fake flattery is so obvious.

320
00:21:40,790 --> 00:21:41,650
Tang Tingting!

321
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:42,750
You...

322
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:47,880
Don't take it too far.

323
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:50,320
When have I, Duan Qiyan,
ever flattered anyone?

324
00:21:50,320 --> 00:21:52,310
This is called win-win cooperation.

325
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:54,710
How could it be the same
as what that kid did?

326
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:55,750
Listen.

327
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:58,160
When I, Duan Qiyan,
look for a girlfriend in the future,

328
00:21:58,160 --> 00:22:00,790
I will find someone
who's completely the opposite of you.

329
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:03,200
I'll find a woman
who's gentle, considerate,

330
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,440
obedient,

331
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,590
and submissive to me.

332
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:08,310
Like the exact inverse function
of someone like you!

333
00:22:08,310 --> 00:22:10,120
Great, Duan Qiyan.

334
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:13,240
I wish you find your gentle
and considerate inverse function soon.

335
00:22:13,240 --> 00:22:14,790
Now, take your great dream

336
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:15,850
and get out of here.

337
00:22:16,110 --> 00:22:17,290
You want an endorsement?

338
00:22:17,290 --> 00:22:18,270
No way!

339
00:22:18,290 --> 00:22:19,240
Fine, whatever!

340
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,590
I'm not doing it anyway!

341
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,400
Stop being so pretentious.
You're tired of it?

342
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,480
Take it or leave it!

343
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:55,990
[Repayment plan for the next 3 months]

344
00:22:56,030 --> 00:23:05,310
[437,000 yuan] [+39,330/3 months]

345
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:09,270
Master Jiang, have you eaten yet?

346
00:23:09,270 --> 00:23:10,600
I brought you a pancake.

347
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,400
You really scared me yesterday.

348
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,030
Cheng.

349
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:15,090
Can we take more orders now?

350
00:23:18,110 --> 00:23:19,570
You want even more orders?

351
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:20,790
No problem.

352
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,310
With your great reputation,

353
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,550
you can get as many as you want.

354
00:23:23,550 --> 00:23:24,350
However,

355
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:27,290
won't that be too much for you physically?

356
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,680
Besides audio equipment,

357
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,960
I'll do any other work

358
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,150
for electronic devices,

359
00:23:32,150 --> 00:23:33,680
smart home modifications,

360
00:23:34,110 --> 00:23:36,110
or industrial controller repairs.

361
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,200
Master Jiang,

362
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,790
this is weird.

363
00:23:43,750 --> 00:23:44,960
In view of your schedule,

364
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:47,690
are you planning
to burn yourself out in 3 months?

365
00:23:48,830 --> 00:23:50,790
Why are you suddenly so fired up?

366
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:54,430
Is it because of that Miss Lin
at the door last time?

367
00:23:54,430 --> 00:23:56,590
Did you two...

368
00:23:56,610 --> 00:23:58,210
It has nothing to do with her.

369
00:23:58,790 --> 00:23:59,650
Stop guessing.

370
00:24:00,590 --> 00:24:01,400
Man...

371
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:03,160
You can fool others.

372
00:24:03,270 --> 00:24:04,200
But you can hardly

373
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:04,830
fool me.

374
00:24:06,030 --> 00:24:07,510
I saw everything last time.

375
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:10,000
She waited at the door
from dawn till dusk.

376
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:11,920
Also,

377
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,520
you texted me in such a panic,

378
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:15,310
telling me to send her away immediately.

379
00:24:15,310 --> 00:24:17,440
She's obviously your ex-girlfriend.

380
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:18,680
Look,

381
00:24:19,270 --> 00:24:21,640
you've been hiding
in this crappy warehouse for 5 years,

382
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:23,930
living like an ascetic monk.

383
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:26,890
You wouldn't even care about
a female cat passing by.

384
00:24:27,550 --> 00:24:29,790
But why is it that she showed up

385
00:24:30,590 --> 00:24:32,590
and suddenly you hid away and panicked?

386
00:24:32,590 --> 00:24:34,790
You even made me
delete her WeChat contact yesterday.

387
00:24:34,790 --> 00:24:36,350
Obviously, you still have
feelings for her,

388
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,510
yet you're too afraid to see her,

389
00:24:37,510 --> 00:24:38,550
making yourself struggle

390
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:39,440
in a dilemma.

391
00:24:39,510 --> 00:24:40,240
Am I right?

392
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:41,590
Cheng.

393
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:44,270
You still have a game console

394
00:24:44,270 --> 00:24:46,200
waiting for a new chip here, right?

395
00:24:47,310 --> 00:24:49,030
Leave right now

396
00:24:49,110 --> 00:24:51,400
and don't come back
until you get me 10 orders,

397
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,200
or...

398
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:54,310
I happen to be short
of a few high-end capacitors,

399
00:24:54,310 --> 00:24:55,720
which your game console
just happens to have.

400
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,310
Alright, Master Jiang.

401
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:59,070
I shouldn't have run my mouth.

402
00:24:59,070 --> 00:25:00,510
I'm going to get you orders right now.

403
00:25:00,510 --> 00:25:04,200
I promise you'll be soldering all day,
working your fingers to the bone.

404
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,000
Bye-bye.

405
00:25:10,850 --> 00:25:15,630
[Repayment plan for the next 3 months]
[Go meet Lin Zhixia]

406
00:25:15,780 --> 00:25:23,890
[Sensor Technology Lab]

407
00:25:21,570 --> 00:25:22,250
Baihui.

408
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:23,530
Mom, Dad.

409
00:25:24,140 --> 00:25:25,220
-Baihui.
-Baihui.

410
00:25:25,220 --> 00:25:26,420
What brings you here?

411
00:25:26,660 --> 00:25:28,320
We're here to pick you up to...

412
00:25:28,980 --> 00:25:29,810
Nothing.

413
00:25:29,900 --> 00:25:30,940
I just missed you

414
00:25:30,940 --> 00:25:31,900
and wanted to come to see you.

415
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:33,290
You look tired from studying.

416
00:25:33,290 --> 00:25:34,740
We'll take you out for a nice meal tonight

417
00:25:34,740 --> 00:25:35,570
for nutrition.

418
00:25:35,570 --> 00:25:36,250
Okay.

419
00:25:36,250 --> 00:25:38,010
Look at you, you've lost weight again.

420
00:25:38,010 --> 00:25:39,810
How about we go to my dorm first,

421
00:25:39,810 --> 00:25:40,850
so I can put away my things?

422
00:25:40,850 --> 00:25:41,940
Okay, let's go.

423
00:25:41,940 --> 00:25:42,530
Which way?

424
00:25:42,530 --> 00:25:43,140
This way.

425
00:25:48,420 --> 00:25:50,350
Mom, Dad, come in and rest for a bit.

426
00:25:50,940 --> 00:25:52,460
So this is the grad student dorm?

427
00:25:52,460 --> 00:25:53,010
Yeah.

428
00:25:53,010 --> 00:25:54,420
It is different from the undergrad one.

429
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:55,610
The lighting is great.

430
00:25:55,610 --> 00:25:56,850
I haven't had time to tidy up recently.

431
00:25:56,850 --> 00:25:58,420
It's a bit messy. Have a seat first.

432
00:25:58,420 --> 00:26:00,010
You live in such a big space alone?

433
00:26:00,010 --> 00:26:01,220
My roommate just moved out,

434
00:26:01,220 --> 00:26:03,150
and the new one hasn't moved in yet.

435
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:05,560
So you're basically
living in a single room.

436
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:06,200
Yeah.

437
00:26:07,050 --> 00:26:07,740
It's fine.

438
00:26:08,140 --> 00:26:09,600
Studying is the priority.

439
00:26:09,700 --> 00:26:10,460
Baihui.

440
00:26:11,500 --> 00:26:13,700
You can't spend all your time studying.

441
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:14,850
You still need

442
00:26:14,850 --> 00:26:15,980
to have a life.

443
00:26:16,610 --> 00:26:18,180
I'm used to it.
Studying isn't tiring for me.

444
00:26:18,180 --> 00:26:19,140
That won't do.

445
00:26:19,180 --> 00:26:21,420
You need to get along well
with your classmates

446
00:26:21,420 --> 00:26:22,740
and make more friends.

447
00:26:23,330 --> 00:26:24,610
You might not see it at school,

448
00:26:24,610 --> 00:26:26,220
but once you graduate and enter society,

449
00:26:26,220 --> 00:26:27,770
you'll realize the importance of friends.

450
00:26:27,770 --> 00:26:28,460
Okay.

451
00:26:30,420 --> 00:26:32,250
Speaking of your classmates,

452
00:26:32,650 --> 00:26:34,810
do you guys interact

453
00:26:34,810 --> 00:26:35,700
with the philosophy department?

454
00:26:35,700 --> 00:26:37,090
The philosophy department

455
00:26:37,090 --> 00:26:38,570
doesn't have much interaction with us.

456
00:26:38,570 --> 00:26:40,100
I'm not familiar with them.

457
00:26:40,810 --> 00:26:43,530
I heard about a guy named Li Zhe.

458
00:26:43,610 --> 00:26:44,740
He's good at his studies

459
00:26:44,740 --> 00:26:45,980
and comes from a good family.

460
00:26:45,980 --> 00:26:47,440
Have you ever heard of him?

461
00:26:48,570 --> 00:26:49,500
I don't know him.

462
00:26:58,770 --> 00:26:59,500
Baihui.

463
00:27:00,850 --> 00:27:02,650
Let me just be straight with you.

464
00:27:02,740 --> 00:27:05,380
Do you remember
when your dad and I video-called you,

465
00:27:05,380 --> 00:27:07,240
and there were two madams with us?

466
00:27:08,660 --> 00:27:09,610
One of them

467
00:27:09,610 --> 00:27:10,900
is Li Zhe's mother.

468
00:27:11,570 --> 00:27:14,370
She said Li Zhe had
a really good impression of you.

469
00:27:15,010 --> 00:27:16,940
We're having dinner with them today.

470
00:27:16,940 --> 00:27:18,940
Yes, we're having dinner together.

471
00:27:20,330 --> 00:27:22,130
So we're eating with them today?

472
00:27:27,730 --> 00:27:29,790
Just for you to get to know each other.

473
00:27:33,290 --> 00:27:34,020
By the way...

474
00:27:35,770 --> 00:27:37,220
I also bought you a dress.

475
00:27:37,500 --> 00:27:38,220
Look.

476
00:27:38,770 --> 00:27:39,570
It's pretty.

477
00:27:39,740 --> 00:27:41,600
This really brings out your vibe.

478
00:27:42,250 --> 00:27:43,900
Change into it later, okay?

479
00:27:47,140 --> 00:27:48,530
Alright, Jin.

480
00:27:48,770 --> 00:27:50,610
Let's go first and let her get ready.

481
00:27:50,610 --> 00:27:51,700
Okay.

482
00:27:51,830 --> 00:27:53,690
I happen to have a paper to submit.

483
00:27:53,740 --> 00:27:54,810
I'll go in a bit.

484
00:27:54,810 --> 00:27:55,460
Okay.

485
00:27:55,700 --> 00:27:56,700
Don't be late.

486
00:27:57,460 --> 00:27:58,520
Put on some makeup.

487
00:28:02,330 --> 00:28:03,220
See you later.

488
00:28:14,550 --> 00:28:20,140
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

489
00:28:35,570 --> 00:28:36,380
Hello, Mom.

490
00:28:37,420 --> 00:28:38,290
Did you eat?

491
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:39,400
Yes, I did.

492
00:28:39,810 --> 00:28:40,610
What's wrong?

493
00:28:40,770 --> 00:28:41,810
Nothing.

494
00:28:42,770 --> 00:28:45,100
I just want to confirm something with you.

495
00:28:45,110 --> 00:28:47,670
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

496
00:28:45,610 --> 00:28:46,740
That P2P online lending product

497
00:28:46,740 --> 00:28:47,870
we bought before...

498
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:49,250
I mean the one

499
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:52,290
Jiang Yubai's mom sold.

500
00:28:54,180 --> 00:28:55,340
How did it end up?

501
00:28:56,290 --> 00:28:58,090
Did they provide compensation?

502
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,240
Oh, that thing.

503
00:29:00,550 --> 00:29:02,010
Yes, they did compensate.

504
00:29:02,330 --> 00:29:03,710
But we were lucky.

505
00:29:03,730 --> 00:29:05,290
We got all our principal back.

506
00:29:05,290 --> 00:29:07,020
The interest was gone for sure.

507
00:29:07,140 --> 00:29:09,700
I heard many people
didn't even get their principal back.

508
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:10,980
It was so miserable.

509
00:29:12,470 --> 00:29:14,750
Is it called Xinrong Wealth?

510
00:29:16,530 --> 00:29:17,410
Let me think.

511
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:19,980
Yes, that's it.

512
00:29:20,460 --> 00:29:22,070
Why the sudden question?

513
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:23,730
Did you run into something?

514
00:29:23,810 --> 00:29:25,070
Are you short of money?

515
00:29:25,330 --> 00:29:26,000
No.

516
00:29:26,770 --> 00:29:28,330
I just saw a similar case

517
00:29:28,330 --> 00:29:29,460
on the news,

518
00:29:30,220 --> 00:29:31,660
so I asked.

519
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:32,970
Okay.

520
00:29:33,900 --> 00:29:35,030
I won't keep you any longer.

521
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:38,050
Zhixia, you must tell us
if something happens.

522
00:29:39,380 --> 00:29:40,050
Bye.

523
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:51,210
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

524
00:29:49,330 --> 00:29:51,570
He's basically like a human 3D printer.

525
00:29:52,660 --> 00:29:54,070
It's also said that he's very handsome

526
00:29:54,070 --> 00:29:55,400
but very short of money.

527
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,790
Does anyone know why?

528
00:30:03,850 --> 00:30:05,010
Sorry, I'm late.

529
00:30:05,010 --> 00:30:05,850
Baihui, come here.

530
00:30:05,850 --> 00:30:07,150
Hello, Baihui.

531
00:30:07,290 --> 00:30:08,890
-Have a seat.
-Hello, madam.

532
00:30:09,420 --> 00:30:10,050
Sit down.

533
00:30:11,700 --> 00:30:12,530
Baihui,

534
00:30:12,570 --> 00:30:14,220
I heard you're so busy with your studies,

535
00:30:14,220 --> 00:30:15,900
yet you made a special trip here.

536
00:30:15,900 --> 00:30:16,700
It's nothing.

537
00:30:16,700 --> 00:30:17,460
Actually,

538
00:30:17,460 --> 00:30:20,980
we don't want her to spend all her time
studying at school either.

539
00:30:20,980 --> 00:30:21,770
Baihui,

540
00:30:22,250 --> 00:30:23,460
this is Li Zhe,

541
00:30:23,460 --> 00:30:24,330
your senior

542
00:30:24,420 --> 00:30:25,610
from the philosophy department.

543
00:30:25,610 --> 00:30:26,540
Nice to meet you.

544
00:30:28,140 --> 00:30:28,940
Baihui,

545
00:30:29,220 --> 00:30:32,280
Li Zhe always talks about you at home
with his dad and me,

546
00:30:32,610 --> 00:30:34,460
saying that you're an excellent student

547
00:30:34,460 --> 00:30:35,860
with a calm personality.

548
00:30:36,330 --> 00:30:37,900
We've finally met you today.

549
00:30:37,900 --> 00:30:39,660
You really are a wonderful girl.

550
00:30:39,660 --> 00:30:40,380
Thank you.

551
00:30:41,140 --> 00:30:42,980
This is also my first time meeting Li Zhe.

552
00:30:42,980 --> 00:30:44,050
He's also

553
00:30:44,050 --> 00:30:45,380
a handsome gentleman.

554
00:30:47,770 --> 00:30:49,570
Everyone, let's eat up.

555
00:30:49,900 --> 00:30:51,210
Baihui, have as much as you want.

556
00:30:51,210 --> 00:30:51,800
Okay.

557
00:30:51,820 --> 00:30:53,700
Li Zhe, take care of Baihui.

558
00:30:53,700 --> 00:30:54,050
Okay.

559
00:30:54,860 --> 00:30:55,680
By the way,

560
00:30:55,900 --> 00:30:56,550
Jin.

561
